  "user_request_original": "Design a planar multilayer dielectric film with air incidence on a fused_silica substrate. Use exactly 20 layers in alternating sequence: hfo2, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), hfo2, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), hfo2, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), hfo2, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), hfo2, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), hfo2, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), hfo2, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), hfo2, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), hfo2, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), hfo2, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos). Optimize individual layer thicknesses in nanometers to maximize transmittance in 800-1500 nm wavelength band and maximize reflectance in 200-400 nm wavelength band. Assume normal incidence (0 degrees) and unpolarized light. Total layer count is fixed at 20. Materials are restricted to hfo2 and SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) only. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, run_status, and thicknesses_nm for each optimization round.",
